            "review_title": "Review at Munterra Vung Tau",
            "review_text": "Andrea S\nBrisbane, Australia11 contributions\n0\nNice place, just need to get the menu right\nJul 2026 • Family\nThe place is really lovely and staff are very attentive. \n8 meals came out at different times and even the chips and burger were served differently. \nThe food was tasty but there just wasn't a lot of it. \nThere was only one serve of pasta left and the entire pizza menu wasn't available. There was also at least another 2 missing dishes, leaving a very limited amount to chose from.\nWe paid 4million vnd for 8 meals and 1/2 drinks (4 adults, 4 kids)\nRead more\nWritten July 9, 2026",
