            "review_title": "Review at Munterra Vung Tau",
            "review_text": "thảo vy\nVung Tau, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\n1 year anivesary\nNov 2025 • Couples\nMy boyfriend and I celebrated our 1-year anniversary here, and it was absolutely perfect! The restaurant has a cozy and romantic atmosphere with beautiful décor and warm lighting — ideal for couples.\n\nThe food was amazing — every dish surprised us with how delicious it was, from the main course to the dessert. The staff were super friendly and attentive, especially Nhan, who was so kind and made us feel really comfortable.\n\nThey don’t allow flash photography at night, so keep that in mind if you want to take pictures, but honestly, the lighting is already lovely.\n\nOverall, everything was wonderful — great food, great service, and such a romantic space. Thank you to the restaurant for making our anniversary so special! ❤️✨\nRead more\nWritten November 6, 2025",
